---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="On chain" path="/on-chain" description="Published Move packages with full addresses, and the public source that reproduces them. Every line checkable on its own.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="hero-field" data-field></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div><p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="hash"></span>On-chain records</p><h1>On chain.</h1><p class="lede">Published packages and public source, listed so each line can be checked without asking us. Addresses are full, not truncated.</p></div>
      <figure class="markfig"><div class="markfield" data-mark="hero" data-mark-seq="mark,sui" role="img" aria-label="Blocks building the X, then the word sui."></div></figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="table-wrap" data-reveal><table class="pk"><thead><tr><th>package</th><th>address</th><th class="r">chain state</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody><tr><td class="accent">projectx_raffle</td><td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xb475146208b53d16c3498c9757d623386c17fc197df544386ed496a74e79f8ee">0xb475146208b53d16c3498c9757d623386c17fc197df544386ed496a74e79f8ee</a></td><td class="r num">v6 &middot; fenwick, raffle_v1</td></tr><tr><td class="accent">northlatch_soul</td><td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0x8d6567ed7bf34d99eefefe745c3a282fd89a12fdcd77e6bd10b19b35b599635f">0x8d6567ed7bf34d99eefefe745c3a282fd89a12fdcd77e6bd10b19b35b599635f</a></td><td class="r num">v1 &middot; soul</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <p class="small faint" style="margin-top:16px" data-reveal>Two published packages, listed with their full addresses so each row is checkable on its own. Release digests for the rest of the estate live in git history, tagged per release; a row appears here only once its package carries a full address anyone can resolve. Table checked 2026-11-25 against Sui mainnet over GraphQL.</p>
    <div class="twocol" style="margin-top:48px">
      <div data-reveal><p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="terminal"></span>// reproduce anything</p>
        <div class="term"><div class="term-body" style="min-height:0"><div class="c">git clone https://github.com/Northlatch-Labs-LLC/protocolx-verify.git</div><div class="c">cd protocolx-verify</div><div class="c">bash scripts/run-self-gates.sh</div><div class="out">&gt; the same 25 steps CI runs, on your machine <span class="pass">[ ok ]</span></div><div class="out">&gt; a step that cannot run locally is named and skipped, never folded into a pass</div><div class="out">&gt; digest matches.       exit 0</div></div></div></div>
      <div data-reveal><p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="eye"></span>// what&#x27;s public</p><ul class="gets"><li>source of the verify action and its engine</li><li>gate configurations</li><li>test corpus for the tests gate</li><li>release digests since v0.1, in git history</li></ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
